A term continuation in a description keeps spaces past the body column

```
:: t
: :: t
  u
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <dl>
      <dt>t</dt>
    </dl>
    <p>u</p>
  </dd>
</dl>
```

```
:: t
: :: t
    u
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <dl>
      <dt>t</dt>
    </dl>
    <p>u</p>
  </dd>
</dl>
```
